Package: imx585-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), device-tree-compiler
Recommends: linux-headers
Description: DKMS driver for Sony IMX585 image sensor
 This package provides the kernel driver for the Sony IMX585 CMOS
 image sensor for Raspberry Pi and compatible platforms.
 .
 The driver is managed by DKMS and will be automatically rebuilt
 when new kernel versions are installed.
 .
 This driver supports various configurations including 2-lane and
 4-lane MIPI CSI-2 modes, monochrome variants, and customizable
 link frequencies.
